          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "11:Our primary analysis uses 105K steps, sufficient to observe CIVO onset (45K--65K) and classify trajectories. Extended training (${\\sim}$302K steps, one seed) shows complete self-recovery after approximately 190K additional steps post-onset---at substantial computational cost that the frozen $\\dt$-embedding diagnostic eliminates entirely (Appendix~\\ref{sec:extended_training})."
            }
          ],
